    ed_script_help_lua: 'Lua estilo Roblox (se ejecuta aislado): Instance.new("Part"), workspace, game:GetService("Players" / "TweenService" / "RunService" / "UserInputService" / "Lighting" / "Debris" / "CollectionService"), task.wait / task.spawn, eventos con :Connect, Touched, ClickDetector, ProximityPrompt, ScreenGui / TextLabel / TextButton, leaderstats. Tambien funciona on("join"), command("nombre", fn), game.say... 1 stud = 1 bloque.',
    ed_api_title: 'Referencia de la API (Roblox)',
    ed_api: '<p><b>Compatible</b>: Instance.new / Clone / Destroy / FindFirstChild / WaitForChild / GetChildren / SetAttribute; Part (Position, Size, Color, Material, Shape, Transparency, Anchored, CanCollide, CFrame, Touched), PointLight, ClickDetector.MouseClick, ProximityPrompt.Triggered, SpawnLocation, Model:MoveTo; Players (LocalPlayer, PlayerAdded, CharacterAdded, Chatted, leaderstats), Humanoid (WalkSpeed, JumpPower, Health, Died); Workspace.Gravity; Lighting.ClockTime; TweenService:Create + TweenInfo + Enum.EasingStyle; RunService.Heartbeat / RenderStepped; UserInputService.InputBegan / IsKeyDown; ContextActionService:BindAction; Debris:AddItem; CollectionService; HttpService:JSONEncode / JSONDecode / GenerateGUID; BindableEvent; RemoteEvent (local); Value objects; ScreenGui, Frame, TextLabel, TextButton, UICorner, UIStroke, UIListLayout, UIPadding; Vector3, Vector2, Color3, CFrame, UDim2, BrickColor, Random, Enum; task.wait / spawn / delay / defer, wait, spawn, tick, os.time.</p><p><b>Diferencias</b>: 1 stud = 1 bloque (el personaje mide 1,8). Cada jugador ejecuta el script en su navegador (como un LocalScript): lo que crea el script no se comparte con los demás. Las piezas sueltas solo caen al suelo o a un bloque. WalkSpeed 16 y JumpPower 50 equivalen a la velocidad y el salto normales.</p><p><b>No disponible</b>: DataStores, HTTP real, modelos y MeshParts de Roblox, animaciones, Terrain, física completa, Raycast, scripts en varios archivos (require).</p>',
